    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. But hasn't there been a lot of research suggesting that secularism actually provides a more stable foundation for diverse, modern societies? Like, wouldn't relying on religious institutions actually create more conflict in a pluralistic world compared to secular legal frameworks?",
